{"id":"C21327a11b82904a7806a","zh":"随机模型","en":"stochastic model","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","definition_zh":"用于表达随机变量、过程或系统的模型；不能与特定概率模型名称自动互换。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C21327a11b82904a7806a","zh":"随机模型","en":"stochastic model","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"H32e3011b46db89a7f52a","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D7e49a431cabff78cfd9a","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"随机模型"},{"id":"D26664026fabe1c7c3820","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"stochastic model"}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S78c193803ffc5e244523","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"Perrin等提出的轨道不平顺随机模型(Track Irregularity Stochastic Model, TISM)主要利用Karhunen-Loève(K-L)展开和混沌多项式来表达轨道不平顺随机过程,实现了对大量实测不平顺信号的压缩与相关性识别 [7]; Panunzio等采用几乎与文献[7]相同的方法建立了轨道不平顺随机模型,并开展了车辆动力学的相关研究 [8];Lestoille等结合TISM,采用自回归滑动平均模型(Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model, ARMA)和最小二乘法模拟了轨道不平顺的时变规律,分析了列车的长时效动力性能 [9]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sc5b9c19254a1457fbdfd","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Based on the vehicle-track coupled dynamics theory, the calculation results between the track irregularity probabilistic model and track irregularity stochastic model was compared from the aspects of the simulated amplitude of track irregularity and the probability density distribution for dynamic response in the vehicle-track system to verify the validity and high efficacy of the track irregularity probabilistic model.","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S3b7953a3e84bb0df240d","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"迄今为止,以法国科研人员在轨道不平顺随机模型方面的研究最为突出。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_concept_id":"C485d6b38da52b9db4104","target_zh":"轨道不平顺概率模型","target_en":"track irregularity probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C288e37b9caad43948f6f","target_concept_id":"C288e37b9caad43948f6f","target_zh":"自回归滑动平均模型","target_en":"Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6ea8abe3101a6a58ef93","target_concept_id":"C6ea8abe3101a6a58ef93","target_zh":"轨道不平顺随机模型","target_en":"track irregularity stochastic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C3cf0f6e7e87c8448be4f","target_concept_id":"C3cf0f6e7e87c8448be4f","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupled dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_concept_id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_zh":"概率模型","target_en":"probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C7ed75b760cc160f6177a","target_concept_id":"C7ed75b760cc160f6177a","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic response","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}]}